$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 2-(2-((2-Hydroxycyclohexyl)oxy)pyridin-4-yl)phenol (5).
2-((4-Bromopyridin-2-yl)oxy)cyclohexan-1-ol (4a) (500 mg, 1.84 mmol) and
2-hydroxyphenylboronic acid (380 mg, 2.76 mmol, 1.5 equiv) were dispersed
in 1 M Na2CO3(aq) (5 mL) and THF (10 mL) in a 30 mL microwave vial. The
mixture was sonicated at rt, then degassed with a stream of nitrogen for
10 min. PdCl2(PPh3)2 (129 mg, 0.18 mmol, 0.1 equiv) was added and the
vial sealed before heating at 100 °C for 2.5 h. The mixture was cooled
before adding water (30 mL) and extracting with EtOAc (3 × 30 mL). The
combined organic layers were washed with brine (30 mL) before
concentration under reduced pressure. The resulting residue was purified
by FCC (eluent EtOAc/PE 10:90 to 100:0, wet load in DCM). 609 mg of a
pale-yellow solid (quantitative). 1H NMR δ 9.80 (s, 1H), 8.11 (dd, J =
5.4/0.5 Hz, 1H), 7.33 (dd, J = 7.7/1.7 Hz, 1H), 7.23 (ddd, J =
8.2/7.4/1.7 Hz, 1H), 7.12 (dd, J = 5.4/1.5 Hz, 1H), 6.97 (dd, J = 8.2/1.0
Hz, 1H), 6.94 (d, J = 0.8 Hz, 1H), 6.90 (ddd, J = 7.5/7.5/1.1 Hz, 1H),
4.83 (td, J = 8.5/4.6 Hz, 1H), 3.56 (td, J = 9.0/4.2 Hz, 1H), 2.19-2.01
(m, 1H), 1.96-1.83 (m, 1H), 1.70-1.50 (m, 2H), 1.43-1.20 (m, 4H). 13C NMR
(101 MHz, DMSO) δ 163.5, 154.7, 149.0, 146.0, 129.9, 129.9, 124.8, 119.6,
117.2, 116.3, 110.8, 77.6, 70.6, 33.2, 29.3, 23.3, 23.2. m/z MS (TOF ES+)
C17H20NO3 [MH]+ calcd, 286.1; found, 286.2. LC-MS t R: 3.23 min.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
